** It became the first biopic and the 62nd overall to gross over $1 billion worldwide.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Rubin|first=Rebecca|date=2026-07-12|title=‘Michael’ Crosses $1 Billion, First Biopic to Surpass Coveted Box Office Milestone|url=https://variety.com/2026/film/box-office/michael-billion-dollar-box-office-benchmark-biopic-record-1236802496/|access-date=2026-07-12|website=Variety|language=en-US}}</ref>
** [[Jaafar Jackson]], who made his acting debut in ''Michael'', became the first lead actor to debut with over $1 billion.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Kumar |first=Harshit |date=2026-07-12 |title=29-Year-Old Jaafar Jackson Makes History as the First Lead Actor to Debut With a $1 Billion Film |url=https://www.netflixjunkie.com/hollywood-news-twenty-nine-year-old-jaafar-jackson-makes-history-as-the-first-lead-actor-to-debut-with-a-billion-dollar-film |access-date=2026-07-13 |website=Netflix Junkie}}</ref>
