** ''Super Mario'' became the first [[animated film]] franchise with two films opening with more than $350 million worldwide.<ref>{{Cite web |last=D'Alessandro|first=Anthony|date=April 5, 2026|title='Super Mario Galaxy Movie' - All The Box Office Records Broken|url=https://deadline.com/2026/04/super-mario-galaxy-movie-box-office-records-1236780005/|access-date=April 6, 2026|website=Deadline Hollywood}}</ref>
